# Line endings in this repository are LF, on every platform.
#
# Without this file each clone inherits whatever core.autocrlf its machine has —
# this one has `true` — so a Windows and a Linux checkout disagree about the
# bytes of every text file. Phase 5 hands the same tree to an Android toolchain
# and any CI runner is a second platform by definition, so the rule belongs in
# the repo rather than in each machine's config.
#
# `eol=lf` on the catch-all is what makes extensionless files like
# .gitattributes and .gitignore deterministic too; per-extension rules would
# leave them falling through to the local autocrlf setting.
#
# The index is already all-LF, so this normalizes nothing — it pins the state.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never converted in either direction: 22 tracked jpg/webp today, plus the
# png/ico/woff2 types the Capacitor-icon and self-hosted-font work already plans.
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.png   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
